# This file is no longer used.
# All environment variables (including agent settings) are managed in the monorepo root .env.
#
#   cp ../../.env.example ../../.env
#   # Fill in real values, especially OPENAI_API_KEY
#
# - Docker Compose ('make dev'): reads root .env automatically.
# - Native development ('poetry run uvicorn ...'): config.py reads root .env directly.
#
# See ../../.env.example for the full variable reference.
